  "rows": [
    {
      "kind": "caption",
      "source_text": "『パワフルスマイルライブ』当日……",
      "text_ref": null,
      "speaker": {
        "kind": "none",
        "entityType": null,
        "entityId": null,
        "sourceName": ""
      },
      "inline_translation": null,
      "has_voice": false,
      "anchor": {
        "row_id": "1_4_002_08_g:step-2:caption",
        "step_id": 2,
        "step_index": 1,
        "source_part_id": "1_4_002_08_g",
        "source_file": null,
        "command_start": null,
        "command_end": null,
        "playback": {
          "file": "episodes/1_4_002_08_g.json",
          "start_step_index": 0,
          "end_step_index": 38,
          "target_step_index": 1
        }
      },
      "option": null
    },
    {
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "source_text": "座席はこちらです。何かありましたら、\nお近くのスタッフにお声がけください！",
      "text_ref": null,
      "speaker": {
        "kind": "named",
        "entityType": null,
        "entityId": null,
        "sourceName": "男極スタッフ"
      },
      "inline_translation": null,
      "has_voice": false,
      "anchor": {
        "row_id": "1_4_002_08_g:step-4:text",
        "step_id": 4,
        "step_index": 3,
        "source_part_id": "1_4_002_08_g",
        "source_file": null,
        "command_start": null,
        "command_end": null,
        "playback": {
          "file": "episodes/1_4_002_08_g.json",
          "start_step_index": 0,
          "end_step_index": 38,
          "target_step_index": 3
        }
      },
      "option": null
    },
    {
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "source_text": "どうしたの？　ああ、転んでケガしちゃったのか！\n大丈夫、お兄さんと一緒に休憩室に行こう！",
      "text_ref": null,
      "speaker": {
        "kind": "named",
        "entityType": null,
        "entityId": null,
        "sourceName": "アイドルA"
      },
      "inline_translation": null,
      "has_voice": false,
      "anchor": {
        "row_id": "1_4_002_08_g:step-6:text",
        "step_id": 6,
        "step_index": 5,
        "source_part_id": "1_4_002_08_g",
        "source_file": null,
        "command_start": null,
        "command_end": null,
        "playback": {
          "file": "episodes/1_4_002_08_g.json",
          "start_step_index": 0,
          "end_step_index": 38,
          "target_step_index": 5
        }
      },
      "option": null
    },
    {
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "source_text": "本日はお越しいただき、ありがとうございます。\nはい、お手洗いはこちらです。ご案内しますね！",
      "text_ref": null,
      "speaker": {
        "kind": "producer",
        "entityType": null,
        "entityId": null,
        "sourceName": "<P>"
      },
      "inline_translation": null,
      "has_voice": false,
      "anchor": {
        "row_id": "1_4_002_08_g:step-8:text",
        "step_id": 8,
        "step_index": 7,
        "source_part_id": "1_4_002_08_g",
        "source_file": null,
        "command_start": null,
        "command_end": null,
        "playback": {
          "file": "episodes/1_4_002_08_g.json",
          "start_step_index": 0,
          "end_step_index": 38,
          "target_step_index": 7
        }
      },
      "option": null
    },
    {
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "source_text": "（アイドルもスタッフも全員が協力しあって、\nステージの受付や来場者の案内を行っている……）",
      "text_ref": null,
      "speaker": {
        "kind": "producer",
        "entityType": null,
        "entityId": null,
        "sourceName": "<P>"
      },
      "inline_translation": null,
      "has_voice": false,
      "anchor": {
        "row_id": "1_4_002_08_g:step-11:text",
        "step_id": 11,
        "step_index": 10,
        "source_part_id": "1_4_002_08_g",
        "source_file": null,
        "command_start": null,
        "command_end": null,
        "playback": {
          "file": "episodes/1_4_002_08_g.json",
          "start_step_index": 0,
          "end_step_index": 38,
          "target_step_index": 10
        }
      },
      "option": null
    },
    {
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "source_text": "（これなら、無事にステージを開催できそうだ！）",
      "text_ref": null,
      "speaker": {
        "kind": "producer",
        "entityType": null,
        "entityId": null,
        "sourceName": "<P>"
      },
      "inline_translation": null,
      "has_voice": false,
      "anchor": {
        "row_id": "1_4_002_08_g:step-12:text",
        "step_id": 12,
        "step_index": 11,
        "source_part_id": "1_4_002_08_g",
        "source_file": null,
        "command_start": null,
        "command_end": null,
        "playback": {
          "file": "episodes/1_4_002_08_g.json",
          "start_step_index": 0,
          "end_step_index": 38,
          "target_step_index": 11
        }
      },
      "option": null
    },
    {
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "source_text": "●●●●プロデューサーさん、すまない。\nどこかで龍を見なかったか？",
      "text_ref": null,
      "speaker": {
        "kind": "named",
        "entityType": null,
        "entityId": null,
        "sourceName": "信玄 誠司"
      },
      "inline_translation": null,
      "has_voice": true,
      "anchor": {
        "row_id": "1_4_002_08_g:step-16:text",
        "step_id": 16,
        "step_index": 15,
        "source_part_id": "1_4_002_08_g",
        "source_file": null,
        "command_start": null,
        "command_end": null,
        "playback": {
          "file": "episodes/1_4_002_08_g.json",
          "start_step_index": 0,
          "end_step_index": 38,
          "target_step_index": 15
        }
      },
      "option": null
    },
    {
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "source_text": "龍さんなら、向かいの駐車場まで\n来場者のお迎えに行かれましたよ。",
      "text_ref": null,
      "speaker": {
        "kind": "producer",
        "entityType": null,
        "entityId": null,
        "sourceName": "<P>"
      },
      "inline_translation": null,
      "has_voice": false,
      "anchor": {
        "row_id": "1_4_002_08_g:step-17:text",
        "step_id": 17,
        "step_index": 16,
        "source_part_id": "1_4_002_08_g",
        "source_file": null,
        "command_start": null,
        "command_end": null,
        "playback": {
          "file": "episodes/1_4_002_08_g.json",
          "start_step_index": 0,
          "end_step_index": 38,
          "target_step_index": 16
        }
      },
      "option": null
    },
    {
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "source_text": "そうか、ちょっとした確認があって探していたんだ。\n電話も繋がらなくてな。",
      "text_ref": null,
      "speaker": {
        "kind": "named",
        "entityType": null,
        "entityId": null,
        "sourceName": "信玄 誠司"
      },
      "inline_translation": null,
      "has_voice": true,
      "anchor": {
        "row_id": "1_4_002_08_g:step-18:text",
        "step_id": 18,
        "step_index": 17,
        "source_part_id": "1_4_002_08_g",
        "source_file": null,
        "command_start": null,
        "command_end": null,
        "playback": {
          "file": "episodes/1_4_002_08_g.json",
          "start_step_index": 0,
          "end_step_index": 38,
          "target_step_index": 17
        }
      },
      "option": null
    },
    {
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "source_text": "電波が悪かったのか、\n不運で故障してしまったのか……。",
      "text_ref": null,
      "speaker": {
        "kind": "named",
        "entityType": null,
        "entityId": null,
        "sourceName": "信玄 誠司"
      },
      "inline_translation": null,
      "has_voice": true,
      "anchor": {
        "row_id": "1_4_002_08_g:step-19:text",
        "step_id": 19,
        "step_index": 18,
        "source_part_id": "1_4_002_08_g",
        "source_file": null,
        "command_start": null,
        "command_end": null,
        "playback": {
          "file": "episodes/1_4_002_08_g.json",
          "start_step_index": 0,
          "end_step_index": 38,
          "target_step_index": 18
        }
      },
      "option": null
    },
    {
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "source_text": "また何かの不運に\n巻き込まれてるって可能性はあるな。",
      "text_ref": null,
      "speaker": {
        "kind": "named",
        "entityType": null,
        "entityId": null,
        "sourceName": "握野 英雄"
      },
      "inline_translation": null,
      "has_voice": true,
      "anchor": {
        "row_id": "1_4_002_08_g:step-20:text",
        "step_id": 20,
        "step_index": 19,
        "source_part_id": "1_4_002_08_g",
        "source_file": null,
        "command_start": null,
        "command_end": null,
        "playback": {
          "file": "episodes/1_4_002_08_g.json",
          "start_step_index": 0,
          "end_step_index": 38,
          "target_step_index": 19
        }
      },
      "option": null
    },
    {
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "source_text": "試しに今度は、\n●●●●プロデューサーから連絡を……",
      "text_ref": null,
      "speaker": {
        "kind": "named",
        "entityType": null,
        "entityId": null,
        "sourceName": "握野 英雄"
      },
      "inline_translation": null,
      "has_voice": true,
      "anchor": {
        "row_id": "1_4_002_08_g:step-21:text",
        "step_id": 21,
        "step_index": 20,
        "source_part_id": "1_4_002_08_g",
        "source_file": null,
        "command_start": null,
        "command_end": null,
        "playback": {
          "file": "episodes/1_4_002_08_g.json",
          "start_step_index": 0,
          "end_step_index": 38,
          "target_step_index": 20
        }
      },
      "option": null
    },
    {
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "source_text": "あっ、龍さんからです！",
      "text_ref": null,
      "speaker": {
        "kind": "producer",
        "entityType": null,
        "entityId": null,
        "sourceName": "<P>"
      },
      "inline_translation": null,
      "has_voice": false,
      "anchor": {
        "row_id": "1_4_002_08_g:step-24:text",
        "step_id": 24,
        "step_index": 23,
        "source_part_id": "1_4_002_08_g",
        "source_file": null,
        "command_start": null,
        "command_end": null,
        "playback": {
          "file": "episodes/1_4_002_08_g.json",
          "start_step_index": 0,
          "end_step_index": 38,
          "target_step_index": 23
        }
      },
      "option": null
    },
    {
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "source_text": "●●●●プロデューサーさん！？　よかった、\n急に調子が悪くなって焦ったけど、繋がった～！",
      "text_ref": null,
      "speaker": {
        "kind": "named",
        "entityType": null,
        "entityId": null,
        "sourceName": "木村 龍"
      },
      "inline_translation": null,
      "has_voice": true,
      "anchor": {
        "row_id": "1_4_002_08_g:step-27:text",
        "step_id": 27,
        "step_index": 26,
        "source_part_id": "1_4_002_08_g",
        "source_file": null,
        "command_start": null,
        "command_end": null,
        "playback": {
          "file": "episodes/1_4_002_08_g.json",
          "start_step_index": 0,
          "end_step_index": 38,
          "target_step_index": 26
        }
      },
      "option": null
    },
    {
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "source_text": "忙しい時に電話して、ごめん！　実は、駐車場まで\n来たんだけど、お客さんたちが見当たらなくてさ。",
      "text_ref": null,
      "speaker": {
        "kind": "named",
        "entityType": null,
        "entityId": null,
        "sourceName": "木村 龍"
      },
      "inline_translation": null,
      "has_voice": true,
      "anchor": {
        "row_id": "1_4_002_08_g:step-28:text",
        "step_id": 28,
        "step_index": 27,
        "source_part_id": "1_4_002_08_g",
        "source_file": null,
        "command_start": null,
        "command_end": null,
        "playback": {
          "file": "episodes/1_4_002_08_g.json",
          "start_step_index": 0,
          "end_step_index": 38,
          "target_step_index": 27
        }
      },
      "option": null
    },
    {
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "source_text": "目印のコーンのまま進んできたのに、おかしいなぁ。\n……あれ？　コーンがあっちにもある。あっちにも？",
      "text_ref": null,
      "speaker": {
        "kind": "named",
        "entityType": null,
        "entityId": null,
        "sourceName": "木村 龍"
      },
      "inline_translation": null,
      "has_voice": true,
      "anchor": {
        "row_id": "1_4_002_08_g:step-29:text",
        "step_id": 29,
        "step_index": 28,
        "source_part_id": "1_4_002_08_g",
        "source_file": null,
        "command_start": null,
        "command_end": null,
        "playback": {
          "file": "episodes/1_4_002_08_g.json",
          "start_step_index": 0,
          "end_step_index": 38,
          "target_step_index": 28
        }
      },
      "option": null
    },
    {
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "source_text": "もしかして、位置が変わってる！？\nうう。またいつもの、俺の不運か～～！？",
      "text_ref": null,
      "speaker": {
        "kind": "named",
        "entityType": null,
        "entityId": null,
        "sourceName": "木村 龍"
      },
      "inline_translation": null,
      "has_voice": true,
      "anchor": {
        "row_id": "1_4_002_08_g:step-30:text",
        "step_id": 30,
        "step_index": 29,
        "source_part_id": "1_4_002_08_g",
        "source_file": null,
        "command_start": null,
